# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment files. CardVault has no server and needs no secrets today; this
# is here so that the first person who adds one does not publish it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build and tooling caches
*.tsbuildinfo
.vite/
coverage/

# Local working notes, kept on this machine only. audit.md is an internal
# security review: it is incomplete and it records an absolute path to this
# user's home directory, neither of which belongs in a public repository.
# Delete this line to publish it.
/audit.md

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Deliberately NOT ignored, because a fresh clone needs them to build and to run
# OCR offline:
#   eng.traineddata  the uncompressed language model that scripts/sync-ocr-assets.mjs
#                    gzips into public/ocr/eng.traineddata.gz
#   public/ocr/      the engine, WASM cores and language model the app fetches
#                    at runtime; Vite only serves what it can see
#   package-lock.json
